posts.body:
@Rethy
I haven't really used MV action sequences, but if you can't make the eval show text to work, I think you can show the text though the common event in the action sequence. A bit clunky maybe but if it's just for a certain skill(s), it's not a big deal.
You can get the turn count with
$gameTroop.turnCount();
but that was just an example, you can use switches and variables etc too.
